UI-36|ui|Data error state|As a public visitor, I want to understand failures, so that I know why content is missing.|Pages show role=alert paragraph with error message if fetch fails; persists until refresh.|src/pages/Artists.tsx:25; src/pages/ArtistPage.tsx:48; src/pages/ReleasePage.tsx:89
